From 50b3db7db87389a17ad8be1c3c732d2b1ff978cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Lothian <mike@fireburn.co.uk>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:02:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] winewayland.drv: Add system tray support through
 StatusNotifierItem.

Without a user driver NotifyIcon hook explorer shows the tray icons in a
window of its own. Export them to the desktop's tray over D-Bus instead,
with clicks sent back as the usual tray messages and balloons shown through
org.freedesktop.Notifications. Explorer keeps handling icons when there is
no session bus or no StatusNotifierWatcher.
---
 dlls/winewayland.drv/Makefile.in       |   3 +-
 dlls/winewayland.drv/dllmain.c         |  19 +
 dlls/winewayland.drv/systray.c         | 754 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/winewayland.drv/unixlib.h         |   1 +
 dlls/winewayland.drv/waylanddrv.h      |   3 +
 dlls/winewayland.drv/waylanddrv_main.c |   4 +
 6 files changed, 783 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 dlls/winewayland.drv/systray.c

