+ * Wayland driver system tray support
+ *
+ * Icons are exported to the desktop's tray through the StatusNotifierItem
+ * D-Bus interface, and notifications through org.freedesktop.Notifications.
+ * When there is no session bus or no StatusNotifierWatcher, the icons stay
+ * with explorer, which shows them in its own window.
